 92+  0000              DIRSIZ          EQU     3               ; BYTES PER LINE DIRECTORY ENTRY
 93+  0000                                                      ;   [1: SEGMENT] [2: WORD OFFSET]
 94+  0000              LINEREC         EQU     161             ; MAX LINE RECORD: 1 + 80 + 80
 95+  0000              TEXTCOLS        EQU     80              ; MAX CHARS PER LINE
