  5+  1917              ; PARSES DOS COMMAND-LINE PARAMETERS VIA EXTPARM (BDOS.Z8A).
  6+  1917              ; S6ED ACCEPTS ONE OPTIONAL PARAMETER: THE FILENAME TO OPEN.
  7+  1917              ; NO /X SWITCHES DEFINED YET — SCAFFOLD IS READY FOR FUTURE ADDITIONS.
  8+  1917              ;
  9+  1917              ; CALL PARAMS FROM INIT AFTER BUFINIT.
 10+  1917              ; ON RETURN: CY=0  FILENAME FOUND → FILENAME IS POPULATED (ASCIIZ)
 11+  1917              ;            CY=1  NO FILENAME GIVEN → OPEN EMPTY BUFFER
